# Try the API from Visual Studio: run the project (F5), then click "Send request" above a request.
# 1) register or log in, 2) copy the "token" from the answer into @token below.
@api = http://localhost:5080/api
@token = paste-the-token-here

### Is the API and the database up?
GET {{api}}/health

### Register
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "password123", "displayName": "მე" }

### Log in
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a lap (milliseconds) and a drift score
POST {{api}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "carId": "f40", "track": "circuit", "lapMs": 58250, "drift": 640 }

### Leaderboard: best laps with the F40 on the circuit
GET {{api}}/leaderboard?car=f40&track=circuit&type=lap

### Everyone's best per track for a car
GET {{api}}/leaderboard/best?car=f40

### My garage
GET {{api}}/garage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a tuning
POST {{api}}/garage/tunings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "carId": "f40", "name": "წითელი", "settings": { "color": "#c8102e", "finish": "gloss", "ride": -2 } }

### Catalog texts from the database
GET {{api}}/cars

### Admin: numbers
GET {{api}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
